        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>slab</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1SlabAllocator" kindref="compound">SlabAllocator</ref> to destroy (may be nullptr)</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Implements the custom deletion logic for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1SlabAllocator" kindref="compound">SlabAllocator</ref>:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Saves buddy pointer before destruction</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Calls destructor to free pages</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Frees slab structure back to buddy allocator</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>This ensures the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1SlabAllocator" kindref="compound">SlabAllocator</ref> memory is returned to the correct allocator (buddy, not operator delete).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Called automatically by UniquePtr&lt;SlabAllocator, SlabDeleter&gt; when the pointer goes out of scope or is reset. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
